Z||000000||BroCar 87||05-27-2000||12:58 AM||||JUST HAD TO TELL EVERYONE... I recieved a scholarship to First Coast Tech. Institute for Automobile Repair and Refinish. I will be going for FREE! I am sooooooooo happy. I get to "ENHANCE" the appearance of so many more vehicles now.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>On that good note, I also have some bad news. I am not going to have enough time to finish PAINTING my car. I have 2 weeks of school left, and the instuctor won't let us use the materials or shop anymore until SUMMER SCHOOL starts. I would have bought the paint and had it done by now... IF I didn't get that TICKET for speedin.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <BR>I DID Primer the "BEAST" the way the paint will be applied though. So it does look alot better. No messy clearcoat crap all over the car anymore. I will be able to finish this project during the first two days of summer school. But until then, I will have to settle for this "not too shabby" look. I will post some pics of the BEFORE, During, and AFTER.<BR>||||reg||1
